// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Caitlin Murray-Davies 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1071727759" "Caitlin Murray-Davies"
// ProfessionString :
"P3671402508" "Technological Hero Liaison"
// DescriptionString :
"P2856231741" "Caitlin Murray-Davies has been working with computers since the age of 10, and there's nothing she can't program or fix. She used to work for Exarch Industries, programming cybernetic hardware and perfecting their Man-Machine interfaces. One day she was working late in the office when it was attacked by the Freakshow. She was kidnapped and forced to integrate the Freaks' stolen cybernetics into their bodies. After a three month ordeal, she was rescued by the power-suited hero Horatio. She didn't feel safe going back to her old job, so Horatio introduced her to his friends at DATA. After the Rikti War, Horatio retired his suit to work for DATA in his civilian identity of Rick Davies. After several years of courtship, Caitlin and Rick recently married in a small private ceremony."
// HelloString :
"P1397168770" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I found some spots where you can help out.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1911546581" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>This city has plenty of trouble.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3792178728" "Sorry, but you're not on my roster."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2196103166" "I am very glad to be working with you, {HeroName}. Of course, if you were in Atlas Park, you would be working with Rick Davies. Have you met him? He's a really great guy!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1899342906" "Sorry, {HeroName}, but I've got no work for you. Why not check with your other contacts?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2854314173" "You're too busy to be taking on more work."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3588311479" "I don't have anything for you now, but you should come back when you reach Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1983194988" "You're a good friend. <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Try out these new inspirations!</A> Feel free to call anytime."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1271765521" "You are easy to trust. <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>I hope these new enhancements help.</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1899777494" "You've outgrown me, {HeroName}, but I'll always be here if you need to talk."
// LocationString :
"P3870105655" "Galaxy City, Freedom Plaza"
// IntroString :
"P691296237" "This should not appear for this contact."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2669042357" "I have a <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friend</A> who wants to talk with you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1133147051" "I have some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friends</A> who want to talk with you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


