// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Derek Amberson 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P471862342" "Derek Amberson"
// ProfessionString :
"P1110709240" "Natural Hero Liaison"
// DescriptionString :
"P869074112" "Derek Amberson was always a genius at the art of war. Tactics, strategy, swordplay; there was nothing in the martial arena he could not master. After taking a Olympic gold medal in fencing, Derek longed for work that would give him a different kind of reward. When he heard about the trouble in Paragon City, he immediately got on a bus, traveling all night to present himself at the ELITE offices the next morning. As liaison to new heroes with natural abilities, he is passing on his expertise to the next generation of heroes."
// HelloString :
"P1850319878" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Greetings, friend. Let us save the day.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1848564865" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Once again the city cries out for heroes.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P425574204" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Will you help this city in her time of crisis?</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1711444864" "I'm afraid I haven't had the pleasure of your acquaintance."
// FirstVisitString :
"P712294205" "These are troubled times for Paragon City. I am glad to see heroes like yourself rising to the occasion, {HeroName}. I will do everything in my power to assist you in your quest."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3311248873" "I have no more jobs that might interest you, {HeroName}. You should ask your other contacts."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P4138022297" "Even a hero can only do so much. You should finish some of the tasks you already have."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1484332229" "Sorry, but all my tasks require Security Level {Level} or higher."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2068866489" "I am proud to call you friend, {HeroName}. <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>These new inspirations should help your cause.</A> Please call if there is anything I can do for you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3457112362" "You are truly worthy of trust and admiration. <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>I hope these enhancements will help you.</A> "
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1529649654" "{HeroName}, you have surpassed me. Good luck in all your future quests."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P582162567" "I wish to introduce you to a <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friend</A> of mine. I believe you will serve each other well."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P77260308" "I wish to introduce you to some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friends</A> of mine. I believe you will serve each other well."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


