// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Gregor Richardson 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1375738180" "Gregor Richardson"
// ProfessionString :
"P4103257269" "Magic Hero Liaison"
// DescriptionString :
"P533629994" "Gregor Richardson is from Australia, but he's been in America so long that his accent is almost gone, save for the occasional 'mate'. He's a talented artist who spends every moment he can locked away in his studio, painting. Gregor has a knack not just for the fine arts, but for the mystical arts as well. He and Azuria have radically different approaches to magic. She sees it as something to be guided and respected; he sees it as something to be tamed and used. This attitude makes Gregor something of a rebel in mystical circles, which is probably what has kept him off the Arcane Guild's High Council the past several years. They gave him his post as magic hero liaison only grudgingly, unable to deny the power of the magic he can manifest."
// HelloString :
"P3223675316" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Let's do this, mate.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3077445292" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I want you to help me with a couple of problems.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2588365087" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I would really appreciate your assistance on this.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2664947706" "There is no way I can help you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1392950651" "I think we can help each other a great deal, {HeroName}. I'm an expert when it comes to new magic heroes. Whatever you do, don't listen to that Azuria woman over in Atlas Park. She's nuts."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3925683455" "You've done everything I can ask of you, {HeroName}. Why not see what your other contacts have brewing?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P416216573" "You've got a lot on your plate already, {HeroName}."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4122484304" "Come back when you have reached Security Level {Level}. Then we'll talk."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3076303930" "You have been a really good friend so far, {HeroName}. <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Look what I have to offer you in my store.</A> Please call if there is any way I can help you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P149261991" "I think I can trust you. Don't prove me wrong. <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>I found some new enhancements for you.</A>."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2373140490" "You are far beyond me now, {HeroName}. I wish you well."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2523641709" "I know <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>a contact</A> you would benefit from meeting."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3981307801" "I know some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</A> you would benefit from meeting."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


