// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Rebecca Brinell 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2140218995" "Rebecca Brinell"
// ProfessionString :
"P312397254" "Science Hero Liaison"
// DescriptionString :
"P2680949178" "Rebecca Brinell grew up as one of Paragon City's most brilliant young minds.  She graduated at the top of her class and went on to MIT, where her experiments in radio-imaging are still the stuff of legend.  After college, she had her choice of top-paying positions at many research facilities, think-tanks, and corporations.  But Rebecca wanted a job that let her give back to the city she called home.  She became a hero liaison for SERAPH in Paragon City.  There, she could have access to the most radical scientists and innovative thinkers in the world, all while helping new science heroes find their place in the city."
// HelloString :
"P1309944273" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I love this job! Let's go to work!</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2732243501" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Let's catch some bad guys.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1749963177" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I believe I can help you start your career out right, {HeroName}!</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P4247424756" "Sorry, I'm pretty busy right now."
// FirstVisitString :
"P371974761" "Working with new heroes like you, {HeroName}, that's what I live for! As far as I'm concerned, there's no better way to apply my skills and knowledge."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1726391709" "I don't have any more jobs for you, but I bet one of your other contacts does."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P480852450" "You're a little busy to be looking for more projects."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1266501911" "Come back and see me when you reach Security Level {Level}. I just might have something then."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1459478583" "It's easy for me to make friends with people like you, {HeroName}. <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Try out these new inspirations!</A> Call me anytime."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4192343105" "We have built a lasting trust, {HeroName}. <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Try out these new enhancements!</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3867036141" "You're going on to bigger, better things, {HeroName}. Try not to forget about me!"
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2001442031" "I want you to meet a <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friend</A> of mine who can help you!"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3204320851" "I want you to meet some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friends</A> of mine!"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

